<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 3.1 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 3.1 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 3.1 billion zlotys of Polish T-bills at the treasury's 600 million zloty primary tender, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
